window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Cole made the ultimate sacrifice to save me . . . but I'm not letting him go that easily.</b><br> <br> All my life, the only thing I ever wanted was to belong—and then I found him, in my afterlife. A male who infuriated me with his taunts and secret-keeping yet won both my heart and my wolf's.<br> <br> If he thinks I'll let him go that easily, he's wrong. Even if I have to travel to the deepest pits of Tartarus and sell my soul to get him back, I will have him by my side again. Or there'll be Hell to pay . . .<br> <br> Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
